    "“Good question. Here's what I know.”": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Bonne question. Voici ce que je sais. »"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "«Buena pregunta. Esto es lo que sé.»"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Hold on to your pebble, this is going to be good!”": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Accroche-toi à ton galet, ça va être passionnant ! »"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "«¡Agárrate a tu piedrecita, que esto va a estar bueno!»"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“In short: three points to remember.”": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« En résumé : trois points à retenir. »"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "«En resumen: tres puntos clave.»"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Oh, great question! So, listen to this…”": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Oh, super question ! Alors, écoute ça… »"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "«¡Oh, qué buena pregunta! Escucha esto…»"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“You again? Fine, I'll tell you everything.”": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Encore toi ? Allez, je te dis tout. »"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "«¿Otra vez tú? Venga, te lo cuento todo.»"
          }
        }
      }
    },
